OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor and former politician
OL,4,AJeffrey Archer dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Conservative MP was jailed
OL,7,Ffor perjury in 2001 after being found
OL,8,Fguilty of lying and cheating in his
OL,9,F1987 libel case against the Daily Star.
